# Data & models
# data/raw holds the downloads. DVC registers them (decision agenda 4.8, step 9) and lists the
# folders it tracks in data/raw/.gitignore, keeping its .dvc files beside them. data/raw itself
# must not be ignored: DVC skips git-ignored folders when it looks for .dvc files. The older
# downloads, not registered, are ignored here one by one.
data/raw/acl/
data/raw/arxiv/
data/raw/openalex_full/
data/raw/openalex_seed43/
data/raw/openalex_unfiltered/
data/raw/openalex_words/
data/processed/*
# The annotation cache (DocBin), rebuildable
data/interim/
data/external/*
data/retired/
models/*
# Loose source files (not committed)
data/*.pdf
data/*.epub
data/*.djvu
data/*.mobi
data/*.azw3
data/*.txt
data/*.html
data/*.htm
!data/words_of_interest.txt
!data/control_words.txt
!data/control_words_cross_field.txt
!data/control_words_rung3.txt
!data/control_words_senses.txt
!data/technology_terms.txt
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/external/.gitkeep
!models/.gitkeep

